title: Friedrich Stampfer
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor
card-image: img/portraits/StampferFriedrich.jpg
view-if: stampfer_advisor = 1
new-page: true 

= Friedrich Stampfer

Friedrich Stampfer is [? if chancellor = "Stampfer": the current Chancellor and ?][? if president = "Stampfer": the current President and ?] the long-time editor-in-chief of Vorwärts, our party newspaper, and also a Reichstag member. He was historically part of the Majority SPD that supported our participation in the Great War, but also supports cooperation with the [+ uspd_name +] to save the Republic.

- @media_
- @faction_support_
- @kpd_cooperation
- @chancellor
- @president
- @root: Return to main


@media_
title: Media
subtitle: Manage our party's newspapers and media.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; media_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: media


@faction_support_
title: Editorial Line
subtitle: We can change the editorial line of Vorwärts to support a particular faction.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6

Which faction should we support?

- @support_left: Left
- @support_center: Center
- @support_labor: Labor
- @support_reform: Reformists
- @support_neorev: Neorevisionists

@support_left
on-arrival: left_dissent -= 8; left_strength += 8

Vorwärts prints editorials in support of Left positions.

@support_center
on-arrival: center_dissent -= 8; center_strength += 8

Vorwärts prints editorials in support of centrist positions.

@support_labor
on-arrival: labor_dissent -= 8; labor_strength += 8

Vorwärts prints editorials in support of the policies of the trade unions.

@support_reform
on-arrival: reformist_dissent -= 8; reformist_strength += 8;

Vorwärts prints editorials in support of the reformist policies.

@support_neorev
view-if: neorevisionism
on-arrival: neorevisionist_dissent -= 8; neorevisionist_strength += 8

Vorwärts prints editorials in support of neorevisionist ideas.

@kpd_cooperation
title: Cooperation with the [+ uspd_name +]
subtitle: Could we build closer ties with the [+ uspd_name +]?
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_strength += 2; kpd_relation += 4*(1-dissent); reformist_dissent += 2

Stampfer works towards closer ties with the [+ uspd_name +] through our media.

@chancellor
title: Use the Chancellorship
subtitle: As the current Chancellor, Stampfer can make use of their position to further our goals.
view-if: chancellor == "Stampfer"
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
go-to: chancellor

@president
title: Use the Presidency
subtitle: As the current President, Stampfer can make use of their position to further our goals.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
view if: president == "Stampfer"

- @article_48: We can use Article 48!
- @military_relations: We can improve our relations with the Reichswehr.
- @on_the_world_stage: We can improve our relations on the world stage.
- @presidential_snap_election: We can call snap elections!
- @reichsexecution: We can order a Reichsexekution!

@article_48
choose-if: chancellor_party == "SPD" and not presidential_powers and article_48_timer <= 8 and judicial_reform >= 3 and ((neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed >= 50) or in_emergency_government)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 3 : The reactionary judiciary would strike them down as unconstitutional. ?][? if neorevisionist_strength+left_strength+unemployed < 50 : The party views these decrees as unecessary. ?][? if article_48_timer > 8 : [+ article_48_timer +] months before we can next take this action. ?]
go-to: article_48

@military_relations
view-if: not victory_republic
choose-if: military_relations_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ military_relations_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: military_relations

@on_the_world_stage
choose-if: on_the_world_stage_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ on_the_world_stage_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: on_the_world_stage

@presidential_snap_election
go-to: presidential_snap_election

@reichsexekution
choose-if: reichsexekution_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ reichsexekution_timer +] months before we can next take this action.
go-to: reichsexekution
